* g1_osc replaced (--osc ideal): ideal 9.436194721 MHz clock of run_top.py, gated by en; no supply current
.subckt g1_osc en trim_0_ trim_1_ trim_2_ trim_3_ osc_clk VDD VSS
Vosc_i osc_i VSS pulse(0 1.2 1e-07 1n 1n 5.19875e-08 1.05975e-07)
Ben_g en_g VSS V = v(en, VSS) * min(1, max(0, (time - 0.1u) / 50n))
Bosc_clk osc_clk VSS V = v(osc_i, VSS) * (0.5 + 0.5*tanh((v(en_g, VSS) - 0.6)/0.05))
Rosc_vdd VDD VSS 1e12
.ends
